title: SecondSpiritIntro
---
<<declare $secondspiritTalkTo = 0>>
<<set $secondspiritTalkTo = 1>>


<<play_cutscene PlayerCutsceneAnimator character_scared>>
<<play_cutscene CutsceneAnimator spiky-spirit-appear>>
<<play_emote_plain player_emote exclaim>>
Spiky Spirit: <wave>Yawn...</wave> Hmm...? Who is it?
Dawn: Not again!
Spiky Spirit: Awfully rude you are... Who let you in?
Spiky: bleh bleh bleh anyways oh you need ingredients for your breakfast meal? ok look in the storage room for some cooking grease then come back.
===

title: searchingStockRoomGrease
---
<<declare $foundGreaseItem = false>>

Just a bunch of old stuff...
Where to look?
    -> Inside the boxes
        Dawn: Nothing here but dust and cobwebs...
    -> Behind the cans
        Dawn: Ew... I think I saw a spider!
    -> In the luggage
        Something [o]glimmers[/o] inside...
        Dawn: Oh there it is!
        <<set_story StoryManager foundGrease>>
        <<set $foundGreaseItem = true>>

//Retry if didn't find
<<if $foundGreaseItem == false>>
    <<jump searchingStockRoomGrease>>
<<endif>>
===